# HTTP Tests

### Get OAuth2-client-config through the client (needs the sbc application running on port 8080)
GET http://localhost:8081/client/oauth2-config

### Get all users (needs the Cassandra of this folder: docker compose up -d)
GET http://localhost:8081/users

### Get a user by ssn
GET http://localhost:8081/users/111-11-1111

### Add a user
POST http://localhost:8081/users
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "ssn": "333-33-3333",
  "firstName": "Grace",
  "lastName": "Hopper",
  "email": "grace.hopper@example.com"
}
